    "original_text": "Authored exact standard Gaussian background implication consumed by SPHMC (4.3):\n{E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n    [CompleteSpace E] [FiniteDimensional ℝ E] [MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E]\n    {L : ℝ≥0} {f : E → ℝ} (hf : LipschitzWith L f) (t : ℝ) :\n    (∫ x, Real.exp (t * (f x - ∫ z, f z ∂ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E))\n      ∂ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E) ≤ Real.exp ((L : ℝ)^2 * t^2 / 2)\nInternal proof regularity is removed before this public statement.",
